  "description": "Fuaran.Core.AiSurface — the generic AI-surface seam: a per-domain witness bundling read tools, the mutation-op emission catalogue (JSON schema per op kind), an NL→op pattern bank with a deterministic fast-path resolver, a proposals/approval flow with agent-readable rejection guidance, and proposal arbitration (which subset of N op-script proposals can land together against one base tree — batch canApply + greedy footprint independence, a deterministic total partition with typed rejections). All read-tool logic, pattern content, and policy rules stay domain-side; the core owns only the shapes. FSharp.Core + Fuaran.Core.Wire + Fuaran.Core.Ops only, Fable-clean.",
